OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FAlex Humphreys introduces an
OL,7,     Fafternoon of great music-making
OL,8,     Fincluding highlights from the
OL,9,     FBaltic Sea Festival and chamber
OL,10,     Fmusic from the East Neuk Festival.
OL,11,G1600 Composer of the Week: The Venetian
OL,12,G     School
OL,13,     F2/5. Donald Macleod examines the
OL,14,     Finfluence of St Mark on the music
OL,15,     Fof the Venetian School.
OL,16,G1700 In Tune
OL,17,     FViolinist Liya Petrova performs
OL,18,     Flive in 80A. Sir Mark Elder joins
OL,19,     FKatie Derham in studio to discuss
OL,20,     Fconducting the Orchestra of the
OL,21,     FAge if Enlightenment in Bizet's
OL,22,     FL'Arlesienne.
