OL,5,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,6,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,7,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,8,     Ffavourites.
OL,9,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,10,     FCelebrate 30 years of The
OL,11,     FBridgewater Hall with the Halle,
OL,12,     Ffeaturing Liszt's Les preludes,
OL,13,     FMacMillan's deeply personal Sixth
OL,14,     FSymphony and Beethoven's 'Emperor'
OL,15,     FConcerto.
OL,16,G2145 The Essay: Towards Evensong
OL,17,     FCelebrating a hundred years of the
OL,18,     FBBC's broadcasting of Choral
OL,19,     FEvensong. Matthew Bannister, a
OL,20,     Fformer head chorister and a
OL,21,     Fverger, meets the people that make
OL,22,     Fthis service happen.
